{
  "uid": "todo-api-j3",
  "title": "Todo API — les quatre golden signals",
  "description": "Tableau de bord d'astreinte. Les quatre premiers panneaux repondent aux quatre questions qu'on se pose face a un service en feu : repond-il, combien, combien ratent, et en combien de temps. Les deux derniers servent au diagnostic une fois qu'on sait qu'il y a un probleme.",
  "tags": ["todo-api", "j3", "astreinte"],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": true,
  "refresh": "5s",
  "time": { "from": "now-15m", "to": "now" },
  "templating": { "list": [] },
  "annotations": { "list": [] },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "1 · Disponibilite",
      "description": "up vaut 1 si le dernier scrape a reussi, 0 sinon. Prometheus la genere tout seul pour chaque cible, sans une ligne de code cote application. Un 0 ici veut dire 'cette application ne repond plus', point final. Avec un scrape toutes les 5 secondes, la bascule se voit en moins de quinze.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "up{job=\"todo-api\"}",
          "legendFormat": "todo-api",
          "instant": false
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "min": 0,
          "max": 1,
          "decimals": 0,
          "mappings": [
            { "type": "value", "options": { "0": { "text": "HORS SERVICE", "color": "red", "index": 0 } } },
            { "type": "value", "options": { "1": { "text": "EN LIGNE", "color": "green", "index": 1 } } }
          ],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "red", "value": null },
              { "color": "green", "value": 1 }
            ]
          },
          "noValue": "AUCUNE DONNEE"
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "2 · Trafic — requetes par seconde",
      "description": "rate() sur un counter, jamais sa valeur brute : un compteur lu tel quel ne donne qu'un cumul depuis le demarrage, un chiffre qui ne dit rien du rythme actuel et qui retombe a zero a chaque redeploiement. Le scrape de Prometheus lui-meme est exclu (route != /metrics), sinon il compterait pour un cinquieme du trafic affiche.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 9, "x": 6, "y": 0 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum(rate(http_requests_total{route!=\"/metrics\"}[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "total"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum by (route) (rate(http_requests_total{route!=\"/metrics\"}[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{route}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 10, "showPoints": "never" },
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "blue", "value": null }] }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "total" },
            "properties": [{ "id": "custom.lineWidth", "value": 3 }]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "3 · Erreurs — part de reponses 5xx",
      "description": "La part, pas le nombre. Dix erreurs sur dix requetes et dix erreurs sur dix mille ne demandent pas la meme reaction. Le panneau reste vide quand aucune requete n'arrive : une division par zero n'a pas de valeur a afficher, et inventer un 0 % ferait croire que tout va bien alors que plus personne n'appelle. Un 503 ici, c'est la base ; un 500, c'est le code.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 9, "x": 15, "y": 0 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "100 * (sum(rate(http_requests_total{status=~\"5..\"}[1m])) or vector(0)) / sum(rate(http_requests_total[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "5xx"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "100 * (sum(rate(http_requests_total{status=~\"4..\"}[1m])) or vector(0)) / sum(rate(http_requests_total[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "4xx (pour comparaison)"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 100,
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 15, "showPoints": "never" },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "orange", "value": 1 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 5 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "5xx" },
            "properties": [{ "id": "color", "value": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "red" } }]
          },
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "4xx (pour comparaison)" },
            "properties": [{ "id": "color", "value": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "text" } }]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "4 · Latence — p95 du temps de reponse",
      "description": "Le p95 : 95 % des requetes sont plus rapides que cette valeur. Pas la moyenne, qui ment — une API qui repond en 5 ms la plupart du temps mais traine a 4 secondes pour 5 % des appels affiche une moyenne tout a fait honorable qui ne raconte rien du vecu de ces 5 %. La mediane (p50) est la a cote pour montrer l'ecart entre les deux.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 7, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 6 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum(rate(http_request_duration_seconds_bucket{route!=\"/metrics\"}[1m])) by (le))",
          "legendFormat": "p95"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum(rate(http_request_duration_seconds_bucket{route!=\"/metrics\"}[1m])) by (le))",
          "legendFormat": "p50 (mediane)"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 8, "showPoints": "never" },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "orange", "value": 0.25 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 1 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "5 · Metier — taches en base, par etat",
      "description": "Le panneau que personne d'autre ne peut deviner, et celui qui distingue un tableau de bord generique d'un tableau de bord utile. Une jauge, pas un compteur : elle decrit l'etat present et elle redescend. Si elle tombe brutalement a zero alors que le trafic continue, ce n'est pas l'API qui a un probleme, c'est la base — ou pire, quelqu'un vient de vider une table.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 7, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 6 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "todo_tasks_in_database",
          "legendFormat": "{{status}}"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum(todo_tasks_in_database)",
          "legendFormat": "total"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0,
          "decimals": 0,
          "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 10, "showPoints": "never", "stepAfter": true },
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "purple", "value": null }] }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "6 · Diagnostic — requetes par code de statut",
      "description": "Le panneau qu'on ouvre APRES avoir vu que le panneau Erreurs s'allume, pour savoir de quoi il s'agit. 503 : la base est injoignable, l'API va bien. 500 : c'est le code. 404 en rafale sur la route (inconnue) : quelqu'un scanne. 400 : des clients envoient n'importe quoi, ce qui n'est pas une panne.",
      "gridPos": { "h": 7, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 13 },
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum by (status) (rate(http_requests_total{route!=\"/metrics\"}[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{status}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "min": 0,
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "bars",
            "lineWidth": 1,
            "fillOpacity": 60,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "stacking": { "mode": "normal", "group": "A" }
          },
          "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "green", "value": null }] }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byRegexp", "options": "5.." },
            "properties": [{ "id": "color", "value": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "red" } }]
          },
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byRegexp", "options": "4.." },
            "properties": [{ "id": "color", "value": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "orange" } }]
          },
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byRegexp", "options": "2.." },
            "properties": [{ "id": "color", "value": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "green" } }]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "right", "showLegend": true, "calcs": ["lastNotNull", "max"] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      }
    }
  ]
}
